ATC Examiner 

ATS Subang shall have qualified ATCE appointed by the CEO. The 
appointment is for a term of 2 calendar years. 

The minimum required qualification for appointment as ATCE shall be as 
follows: 
 Hold a valid Air Traffic Controller licence; 
